<span class=3D"line"><span style=3D"color:#B392F0">ffmpeg</span><span style=
=3D"color:#79B8FF"> -i</span><span style=3D"color:#9ECBFF"> input.mp4</span=
><span style=3D"color:#79B8FF"> -vf</span><span style=3D"color:#9ECBFF"> fp=
s=3D</span><span style=3D"color:#79B8FF">30</span><span style=3D"color:#79B=
8FF"> -c:v</span><span style=3D"color:#9ECBFF"> libx264</span><span style=
=3D"color:#79B8FF"> -crf</span><span style=3D"color:#79B8FF"> 23</span><spa=
n style=3D"color:#79B8FF"> -c:a</span><span style=3D"color:#9ECBFF"> copy</=
span><span style=3D"color:#9ECBFF"> output.mp4</span></span></code></pre><b=
utton class=3D"copy-btn" aria-label=3D"Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id=3D"problem-2-timelapse-has-audio-thats-too-long">Problem 2: Timelaps=
e Has Audio That=E2=80=99s Too Long</h3>
<p><strong>Symptom:</strong> Video is short but audio runs for the original=
