<strong>Cause:</strong> <code>fps=3D1</code> shortens the video but leaves =
audio unchanged<br>
<strong>Fix:</strong> Remove audio for timelapse:</p>
<div class=3D"pre-wrapper"><pre class=3D"astro-code github-dark" style=3D"b=
